{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation evaluation objective recommendation evaluation objective","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","fileName":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-10-04 14:56\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Recommender System Evolution]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","Learning to Rank","Algorithmic Accountability","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation evaluation objective recommendation evaluation objective","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","fileName":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective","heading":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A recommendation evaluation objective specifies what outcome the system is trained and tested to improve. Rating error, click-through rate, watch time, completion, conversion, diversity, and satisfaction reward different behaviors, so selecting the metric helps define what the recommender learns to do.\n\nYouTube's early click-optimized system illustrates objective misalignment: enticing but disappointing videos generated more clicks and were mistakenly rewarded. Moving attention toward watch time changed the ranking behavior and user experience. [[Learning to Rank]] can optimize an ordered set of candidates, but [[Algorithmic Accountability]] still requires asking whose outcome the objective represents and checking the consequences through real-world experiments.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","Learning to Rank","Algorithmic Accountability","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"recommendation evaluation objective recommendation evaluation objective","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","fileName":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Recommendation Evaluation Objective","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[recommendationengines.epub]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Recommender System Evolution","Learning to Rank","Algorithmic Accountability","recommendationengines.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}